  "operative_text": "(a_in_person_id) not stated.\n(b_no_id_remedy) not stated.\n(c_mail_ballot_id) not stated.\n(d_proof_of_citizenship) not stated.\n(other) § 24.2-103: powers and duties of State Board in general; report\n(other) § 24.2-109: appointment and removal of general registrar and officers of election; duties of electoral boards\n(other) § 24.2-671, 675, 678: electoral board meeting to ascertain results; abstracts of votes; law-enforcement officer sent for abstracts\n(other) § 24.2-1001.1 (new): failure or refusal to certify election; civil penalty\n(note) Off this topic: the bill sets no ID or citizenship-proof rule.",
